# Design canvas — track the ARTBOARDS, ignore the seeded output.
# `design/*.dc.html` + `canvas.json` are the design source (~60 KB) and the only
# way to re-seed or extend the canvas later. The published .html is ~2.2 MB of
# bundled editor payload regenerated in one command from those files — and git
# keeps every version, so committing it would add another 2.2 MB blob per edit.
/design/*.html
!/design/*.dc.html
